      "side": 1,
      "message": "I went back and forth on which direction to go for the first patch, but yeah. The failures on D3D12 definitely make it feel like we should change how the view is constructed.\n\nUpdated to have some incompatible internal usages stripped out prior to the view being constructed. I guess it\u0027s possible that this could cause confusion for a Dawn user when they expect an internal storage usage to be there and it\u0027s silently stripped out because of the format, but that seems like a fairly unlikely scenario.",
